  "solution": "Given:\n\n(54, 32, 66)\n\n(49, 31, 54)\n\n**Logic:** Third no. = [(First no. - Second no.) × 3]\n\n**(54, 32, 66) →**\n\n⇒ [(54 - 32) × 3]\n\n⇒ (22 × 3) = 66\n\n**(49, 31, 54) →**\n\n⇒ [(49 - 31) × 3]\n\n⇒ (18 × 3) = 54\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1. (39, 18, 63) →**\n\n⇒ [(39 - 18) × 3]\n\n⇒ (21 × 3) = **63**\n\n2. (44, 28, 52) →\n\n⇒ [(44 - 28) × 3]\n\n⇒ (16 × 3) = 48\n\n3. (68, 49, 55) →\n\n⇒ [(68 - 49) × 3]\n\n⇒ (19 × 3) = 57\n\n4. (55, 30, 70) →\n\n⇒ [(55 - 30) × 3]\n\n⇒ (25 × 3) = 75\n\nHere, **(39, 18, 63)** shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".",
